      "asked_as": "1a1db65e-52d5-493b-a1a9-7e495005530a",
      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 25.82,
      "answer": "SIM bundles are managed through the SIM Cards module, which handles SIM inventory, telco relationships, APN profiles, data bundles, roaming, signal quality, and suspend/reactivate actions. This module provides cost visibility and ensures communication continuity for vehicles, people, cargo, generators, and remote equipment. It helps prevent surprise bills and silent outages by maintaining a complete SIM inventory and mapping SIMs to devices, assets, and countries.\n\nSource: OLIWA User Stories — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
